plicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KIMURA NORITOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKANO MASAHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SATO KATSUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KIMURA, NORITOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKANO, MASAHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SATO, KATSUO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A surface acoustic wave device having an electrode film which contains aluminum single crystal film excellent in power resistance and is formed on a lithium tantalate substrate having a cut corner in the vicinity of 36-degree rotation Y cut, and having an inter-digital electrode on the substrate, the substrate being composed of 38- to 44-degree rotation Y cut lithium tantalate single crystal, the inter-digital electrode containing a titanium film and an aluminum film formed on the titanium film, the aluminum film consisting of a single crystal film in which only spots appear in selected-area electron beam diffraction.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif à ondes acoustiques de surface ayant un film d'électrodes contenant un film d'aluminium monocristallin à résistance excellente et formé sur un substrat de tantalate de lithium dont un coin est coupé à proximité de la coupe en Y avec rotation de 36 DEG . Sur le substrat, composé d'un monocristal de tantalate de lithium coupé en forme de Y avec rotation de 38 à 44 DEG , repose une électrode internumérique contenant un film de titane et un film d'aluminium réalisé sur le film de titane qui est, quant à lui, constitué d'un film monocristallin dans lequel seuls des points apparaissent dans la diffraction d'un faisceau électronique à zone sélectionnée.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>